      },
      "text": "Camp 3 – Lost City – Camp 2"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "55757ad14d9b1b3afc898dcb24ca76b7017530770224d9c2d06eae431caa8de0",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-46f95238a290459398b4283e1f15ccba",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Get up before dawn. After breakfast, set off for the Lost City to arrive with the first light of day.\n\nThe trail passes through dense vegetation and crosses a river. From there, a stone stairway of more than 1,000 steps leads to the ancient Tairona city.\n\nAfter the guided tour, you’ll have free time to explore the site on your own or sit among the ancient terraces and forest. The programme also includes a meeting with a local chief or shaman.\n\nOn the way back, collect your equipment at camp and continue to Adam’s Camp for lunch, which is included. After a short rest and some local fruit, continue to Camp 2 at Bumake.\n\nSleep in hammocks. Dinner at camp is included.\n\nDuration: 7 hours. Distance: 9 km. Elevation: 470 m."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:5de02be3b79cdc64",
