        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Camp 2 – Mamey – Santa Marta"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "47ffd52c7af64af2af288df11ddc21c8897f9f306f478f386c7d59bbf94b937c",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-46f95238a290459398b4283e1f15ccba",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "Set off early after breakfast and continue the descent. The walk takes about 7 hours.\n\nAlong the way, you can try local fruit and juices. Lunch in Mamey is included, followed by about 30 minutes to rest and shower.\n\nThen take a private transfer in a 4x4 pickup to Aguacatero, about 20 minutes away. Continue to the beachfront Ecohabs Resort and check in. Dinner is at your own expense today.\n\nTotal duration: 10 hours. Distance: 7 km. Elevation: 0 m."
    },
